We are very grateful to the Reviewers for valuable questions, fruitful discussions and raising the scores. In the final version, we will make the following edits: 

1) include time convergence graph (Appendix), extra OT baselines and OFM improved metrics (few rows in Table 1), I2I FID (Section $4.3$), FM examples and amortization (Appendix), (nvT5, qt8g);

2) restructure Section 3, (following the reply to YPMs);

3) discuss the intricacy of high-dimensional (i.e., image data) generation in Limitations section, (nvT5, Bhuh).

